@GateHooks
Feature: Gate feature

    Before Feature:
        * Record the gate step before the feature

    Scenario: Gate scenario 1
        * Record the start of gate scenario 1
        * Meet the other scenarios of the feature
        * Record the end of gate scenario 1 once gate scenarios 2 and 3 have ended

    Scenario: Gate scenario 2
        * Record the start of gate scenario 2
        * Meet the other scenarios of the feature
        * Record the end of gate scenario 2

    Scenario: Gate scenario 3
        * Record the start of gate scenario 3
        * Meet the other scenarios of the feature
        * Record the end of gate scenario 3

    After Feature:
        * Record the gate step after the feature
